  "description": {
   "en": "\"Yes, today is your first day of amnesia.\" For Shiota Kai, who repeatedly loses his memories, a new day begins once again. Through encounters with his lover and friends, he struggles to reclaim his lost memories and daily life. But what awaits him beyond that—? A love story of rebirth and destruction, where past, secrets, and intertwined emotions collide."
